{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","author_sig":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","data":{"body":"HANDOFF ADDENDUM — J6 LANDED after the handoff block above was written. Two corrections to it:\n\n 1. Change 1049 is MERGED (origin/main 271f6eaaa), LLM-Review +1 and Verified +1 on PATCHSET 1 — first-pass green. Handoff action #1 ('poll 1049') is DONE; do not repeat it.\n 2. J6 9fd4 remains IN_PROGRESS ON PURPOSE. Its code has landed but two ACs are unmet, both requiring a live Jira: the [operator-attested] live-transport run, and the NameIdentity user-search test. Closing it now would certify work that was not done. These are the FIRST work item for the next session, and BOTH need CI (dispatch external-integration.yml on main) because the harness cannot boot on an arm64 workstation.\n\nTWO MECHANICAL FACTS worth carrying forward, both observed on this submit:\n * 'git merge --ff-only origin/main' REFUSED after the submit, because Gerrit REBASES on submit and the merged SHA is therefore not a descendant of your local commit. That is EXPECTED, not a sign of a lost change. Verify the landed CONTENT (diff your specific files against origin/main) before resetting; never infer 'my change vanished' from a failed fast-forward.\n * origin/main lagged the Gerrit merge by ~20 SECONDS. origin is the GitHub MIRROR. A 'did it land?' check immediately after submit can return a false negative — re-fetch before concluding.\n\nBOARD AT HANDOFF: epic e369 in_progress. J1 acb2, J2 62d9, J3 aac8, J4 0a94, J5 c97f CLOSED+MERGED. J6 9fd4 in_progress, CODE MERGED, 2 live-dependent ACs outstanding. J7 b4e3 OPEN (blocked by J6). J8 8c35 OPEN (blocked by J7).\nWorktree /Users/joeoakhart/rebar-jira-family is CLEAN at origin/main 271f6eaaa. Nothing uncommitted, nothing unpushed, no parked stack.\nTEN changes merged across this epic: 1009, 1010, 1011, 1013, 1015, 1019, 1020, 1026, 1027, 1049.\nOpen tickets filed this session: 65d7 (task), 2bc7 (bug), d59e (bug, in_progress, messaging fix merged / remaining scope recorded), 8070 (bug)."},"env_id":"ade0f2ef-51cc-45a2-bb97-c09846cd3df5","event_type":"COMMENT","timestamp":1785435792947285001,"uuid":"6422cde9-1352-4cd1-bfcf-4c9b465ebc6f"}